/* The embedded payload, and ONE copy of the list.
 *
 * Included by src/patcher/payload.rc (the console patcher) and src/launcher/launcher.rc (the
 * window). Both exes install the same files, so both embed the same bytes; two copies of this
 * list is how one of them ends up shipping a mod the other does not.
 *
 * Paths are relative to the PROJECT ROOT, which is where both build scripts invoke windres
 * from. IDs must match RES_* in install_core.h.
 */

100 RCDATA "payload/dinput8.dll"
101 RCDATA "payload/mafia_ffb.asi"
102 RCDATA "payload/mafia_fp.asi"
103 RCDATA "payload/mafia_fp.ini"
104 RCDATA "payload/gearbox_hook.asi"
/* 105 was gearbox-setup.exe, retired 2026-08-04: ALXG Mafia Mods has an H-shifter tab and a
   second binder in the game folder is a second thing to keep in step with the mod. The id is
   left unused rather than reassigned - a recycled RCDATA id is how a build ends up installing
   one payload under another's name. */
106 RCDATA "payload/gearbox.ini"
